Spa and Bath </b>or visit <b>Botanical Garden Buda</b> and <b>Budapest Zoo</b>. Plus, the International Pier for Danube cruises is just a 15-minute drive away.</p>\n<p>At this hotel you can enjoy:</p>\n<p>- Free WiFi throughout the building</p>\n<p>- A car and coach parking.</p>\n<p>- A buffet breakfast</p>\n<p>- A sauna</p>\n<p>Rooms have coffeemakers and <b>pillow menus. </b>Some offer sofa beds, and <b>kids stay and eat free</b>. The charming <b>garden terrace</b> and stylish <b>lobby bar </b>are ideal spots for unwinding at day's end. At <b>our hotel restaurant</b>, you can choose from delicious Hungarian, Mediterranean or international dishes.</p>"}},"brandInfo":{"SPBrandName":null,"brandCode":"HOLI","brandName":"Holiday Inn","chainCode":"HI","futureBrandInfo":null,"spTransitionalBrandIdentifier":null},"greenEngage":{"certificationPrograms":{"certifiedByGloballyRecognizedSustainableProgram":false,"environmentalCertificationProgram":null},"lowCarbon":{"lowCarbonHotelDescription":null,"isLowCarbonHotel":"No"},"lowCarbonReady":{"lowCarbonReadyHotelDescription":null,"isLowCarbonReadyHotel":"No"}},"room":null,"badges":[{"name":"Wifi Included","id":"WIFI_INCLUDED"},{"name":"IHG Green Engage™ Level 1","id":"GREEN_ENGAGE"}],"facilities":[{"name":"Wireless Internet","id":"WIRELESS_INTERNET"},{"name":"No Pets Allowed","id":"NO_PETS_ALLOWED"},{"name":"Kids Eat Free","id":"KIDS_EAT_FREE"},{"name":"Health/Fitness Center","id":"HEALTH_FITNESS_CENTER"},{"name":"Business Center","id":"BUSINESS_CENTER"},{"name":"EV Charging","id":"EV_CHARGING"},{"name":"In hotel restaurants","id":"IN_HOTEL_RESTAURANTS"},{"name":"Suites","id":"SUITES"}],"parking":{"complimentaryDailySelfParking":false,"parkingDescription":"Outdoor parking lot: 154 places for cars for 10 €/car/night and  5 places for busses for 20 €/bus/night. Garage: 20 €/car/night.","carParkingAvailable":true,"valetParkingAvailable":null},"policies":{"pet":{"petsAllowed":false,"guideDogsOrServiceAnimalsAllowed":true,"descriptio